why An off-hand orb or a staff for your late 30s, down the felhound's or the infernal's path, your pick.

# The Orb of Orahil: Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (4965, 4967, 4968, 4969)
# from your trainer to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet, and Fragments of the Orb
# of Orahil (1799). Menara's two acolytes then each offer one path, and the
# game lets you take only one (Shard of a Felhound 4962 and Shard of an
# Infernal 4963 exclude each other, quests.json `excl`):
# - felhound: Shard of a Felhound (4962) from Acolyte Wytula, ending with The
#   Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil (4964): the Orb or the Staff of Dar'Orahil;
# - infernal: Shard of an Infernal (4963) from Acolyte Magaz, ending with The
#   Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil (4975): the Orb or the Staff of Noh'Orahil.
# Both share the Infernal Orb for Fragments of the Orb of Orahil (1799),
# Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil (4961) and Returning the Cleansed Orb (4976)
# with Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh. The guide lists the felhound path first
# and the infernal one after it; once you take one acolyte's quest the
# other's goals are skipped ("No longer offered"). The two `reward` lines are
# the two ends, each a choice of orb or staff (codex quests.json: 4964
# 15106/15108, 4975 15105/15107).
# This guide merges the former orb-of-orahil, orb-of-dar-orahil and
# orb-of-noh-orahil guides.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers, drops and spawns; the classic quest
# data (quests 1799, 4962, 4963, 4964) for taking the
# acolyte's path before the Infernal Orb, for using the Felhas Ruby on a
# felhound or the Infus Emerald on an infernal, and for waiting while Menara
# finishes the orb; Forever's Warlock class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): unchanged in Forever.
# The Demon of the Orb (4961) is elite.
# Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil (4961) lists Shard of a Felhound (4962) as
# well as 1799 before it (quests.json preAll, from pfQuest and
# Questie-Forever), though 4962 and 4963 exclude each other: whether the
# infernal path still reaches Tabetha in Forever is unconfirmed until launch.
# The separate infernal guide carried lint's warning for it; in this guide
# the felhound turn-in comes earlier, so lint no longer flags it.
# Lint warns that 4963 and 4975 are not offered once 4962 is taken, and 4964
# once 4963 is: that is the merge, kept visible, not hidden.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 35 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4968                         -- Demisette Cloyce

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 35 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4965                         -- Briarthorn

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 35 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4967                         -- Zevrost

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 35 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar.
  level 35
  accept 4969                         -- Kaal Soulreaper

step Menara Voidrender
  zone The Barrens
  tip Menara Voidrender and her two acolytes stand in the tower on the hill above Ratchet, beside Strahad Farsan.
  turnin 4968 only Human              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4965 only Gnome              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4967 only Orc,Troll          -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4969 only Undead             -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 1799

step Choose an acolyte
  tip Pick one acolyte: you can take only one of their quests. Acolyte Wytula's felhound path ends with the Orb or Staff of Dar'Orahil, Acolyte Magaz's infernal path with the Orb or Staff of Noh'Orahil. The guide follows the one you take.
  accept 4962                         -- Acolyte Wytula: she gives you the Felhas Ruby
  accept 4963                         -- Acolyte Magaz: he gives you the Infus Emerald

step Mannoroc Coven
  zone Desolace
  tip The demons of Mannoroc Coven, in southern Desolace, have all you need. Burning Blade Summoners carry the Infernal Orb. On the felhound path, use the Felhas Ruby on a Mana Eater, a felhound, and kill it for its spirit; on the infernal path, use the Infus Emerald on a Lesser Infernal and kill it.
  collect 7291 quest 1799.1           -- Infernal Orb, from the Burning Blade Summoners
  collect 12648 quest 4962.1          -- Imprisoned Felhound Spirit, from a Mana Eater
  collect 12649 quest 4963.1          -- Imprisoned Infernal Spirit, from a Lesser Infernal

step The demon's spirit
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Menara Voidrender in the tower above Ratchet with the spirit first: Tabetha's cleansing follows it.
  turnin 4962                         -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4963                         -- Menara Voidrender

step Tabetha
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Tabetha lives at her farm in western Dustwallow Marsh. She calls the Demon of the Orb out of the Infernal Orb; it is elite: grouping up is advised.
  turnin 1799                         -- Tabetha
  accept 4961
  kill 6549 quest 4961.1              -- Demon of the Orb
  turnin 4961                         -- Tabetha
  accept 4976

step The Orb of Dar'Orahil
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Menara in the tower above Ratchet with the cleansed orb. On the felhound path, wait while she completes the Orb of Dar'Orahil, then speak to her again.
  turnin 4976                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4964
  complete 4964                       -- Wait for the orb
  turnin 4964 choose 15108 15106      -- Menara Voidrender

step The Orb of Noh'Orahil
  tip On the infernal path, wait while Menara completes the Orb of Noh'Orahil, then speak to her again.
  accept 4975
  complete 4975                       -- Wait for the orb
  turnin 4975 choose 15107 15105      -- Menara Voidrender
